# Title: Registry Export of Third-Party Credentials
# ID: cc1abf27-78a3-4ac5-a51c-f3070b1d8e40
# Status: experimental
# Level: high
# Author: Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2025-05-22
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1552.002
# Description: Detects the use of reg.exe to export registry paths associated with third-party credentials.
# Credential stealers have been known to use this technique to extract sensitive information from the registry.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((cmdline:*\\Software\\Aerofox\\Foxmail\\V3.1* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\Aerofox\\FoxmailPreview* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\DownloadManager\\Passwords* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\FTPWare\\COREFTP\\Sites* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\IncrediMail\\Identities* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\Martin Prikryl\\WinSCP 2\\Sessions* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\Mobatek\\MobaXterm* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\OpenSSH\\Agent\\Keys* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\OpenVPN-GUI\\configs* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\ORL\\WinVNC3\\Password* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\Qualcomm\\Eudora\\CommandLine* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\RealVNC\\WinVNC4* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\RimArts\\B2\\Settings* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\SimonTatham\\PuTTY\\Sessions* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\SimonTatham\\PuTTY\\SshHostKeys* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\Sota\\FFFTP* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\TightVNC\\Server* OR cmdline:*\\Software\\WOW6432Node\\Radmin\\v3.0\\Server\\Parameters\\Radmin*)) AND ((cmdline:*save* OR cmdline:*export*)) AND ((process_name:*\\reg.exe) OR (OriginalFileName:"reg.exe")))
